  "version": "0.1.0",
  "title": "Thermistor thermometer on a Nano",
  "summary": "Move the temperature slider. A 10 kΩ NTC thermistor and a 10 kΩ resistor divide 5 V into A0; the Nano computes °C from the B equation, prints it over Serial and lights the LED at 30 °C.",
